/*
  German translation of Reclaim.

  Keys are the English strings from the source code. SwiftUI and String(localized:) turn interpolations
  into format specifiers: String → %@, Int → %lld, Int32 → %d. A literal % in a key that also has
  arguments is written %%. Use positional specifiers (%1$@, %2$lld) when German needs a different order.
  Keys whose German form depends on a count live in Localizable.stringsdict instead.

  "30 days", "6 months" etc. only appear in pickers whose label ends in a preposition ("Nicht geöffnet seit",
  "Downloads gelten als alt nach"), hence the dative.

  Check coverage with ./scripts/check-localization.py
*/

